{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:Observations.HadronHalfLifeVerification","@type":"LeanModule","name":"Observations.HadronHalfLifeVerification","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":73,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.sensitivity_large","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.sensitivity_large","kind":"theorem","line":546,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L546-L549","doc":"Sensitivity > 40 (the decay rate is highly sensitive to q). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.sensitivity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.sensitivity","kind":"def","line":541,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L541-L544","doc":"Sensitivity: 1% shift in q changes decay rate by ~48%.\nFormula: (q²-1)/(q²+1) + 5(q²+1)/(q²-1). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.mu_0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.mu_0","kind":"def","line":537,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L537-L539","doc":"Dimensional scale μ₀ ≈ 1.6296 MeV/Skein. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.E_cross","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.E_cross","kind":"def","line":533,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L533-L535","doc":"Crossing energy E_× = ½(q - q⁻¹) ≈ 0.10452. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.hbarQSq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.hbarQSq","kind":"def","line":529,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L529-L531","doc":"ℏ_q² = Vol(4₁)/(m_μ/m_e) ≈ 0.009816. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.q_substrate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.q_substrate","kind":"def","line":524,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L524-L527","doc":"Substrate parameter q = 1/(1 - √(Vol(4₁)/m_μ/m_e)) ≈ 1.110.\nSource: q_parameter.py witness (CODATA 2022 + SnapPy 3.3.2). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.all_six_corrected_agree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.all_six_corrected_agree","kind":"theorem","line":493,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L493-L518","doc":"All six corrected predictions agree with observation within 20%.\nThe q_eff self-deformation correction (Δq = (A-1)/A² · ℏ_q²)\ntightens tritium from 5.5% overshoot to < 2%, and improves\nall heavier nuclei.  Remaining systematic overshoot (10–17%)\nis attributed to the Skein Coulomb enhancement (Fermi function)\nnot yet included. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.all_six_agree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.all_six_agree","kind":"theorem","line":463,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L463-L487","doc":"All six beta emitters have QOU-predicted half-lives within 25%\nof the NNDC observed values, using q (substrate parameter),\nμ₀ (dimensional unit choice), and the standard-physics value\nof G_F² m_e⁵ (which decomposes into q-dependent factors times\nμ₀, pending derivation of the weak-scale crossing count N_v). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:ex:hadron-half-life-verification","label":"ex:hadron-half-life-verification","md":"quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.bismuth210_prediction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.bismuth210_prediction","kind":"def","line":444,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L444-L457","doc":"Bismuth-210 (²¹⁰Bi → ²¹⁰Po + e⁻ + ν̄ₑ). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.cesium137_prediction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.cesium137_prediction","kind":"def","line":429,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L429-L442","doc":"Cesium-137 (¹³⁷Cs → ¹³⁷Ba + e⁻ + ν̄ₑ). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.strontium90_prediction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.strontium90_prediction","kind":"def","line":414,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L414-L427","doc":"Strontium-90 (⁹⁰Sr → ⁹⁰Y + e⁻ + ν̄ₑ). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.cobalt60_prediction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.cobalt60_prediction","kind":"def","line":399,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L399-L412","doc":"Cobalt-60 (⁶⁰Co → ⁶⁰Ni + e⁻ + ν̄ₑ). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.carbon14_prediction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.carbon14_prediction","kind":"def","line":384,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L384-L397","doc":"Carbon-14 (¹⁴C → ¹⁴N + e⁻ + ν̄ₑ). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.tritium_prediction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.tritium_prediction","kind":"def","line":369,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L369-L382","doc":"Tritium (³H → ³He + e⁻ + ν̄ₑ). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.bismuth210_ratio_lower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.bismuth210_ratio_lower","kind":"theorem","line":359,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L359-L363","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.bismuth210_ratio_upper","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.bismuth210_ratio_upper","kind":"theorem","line":351,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L351-L357","doc":"²¹⁰Bi: predicted 5.8 d vs observed 5.012 d, ratio < 1.16. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.cesium137_ratio_lower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.cesium137_ratio_lower","kind":"theorem","line":345,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L345-L349","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.cesium137_ratio_upper","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.cesium137_ratio_upper","kind":"theorem","line":337,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L337-L343","doc":"¹³⁷Cs: predicted 33 yr vs observed 30.17 yr, ratio < 1.10. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.strontium90_ratio_lower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.strontium90_ratio_lower","kind":"theorem","line":331,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L331-L335","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.strontium90_ratio_upper","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.strontium90_ratio_upper","kind":"theorem","line":323,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L323-L329","doc":"⁹⁰Sr: predicted 32 yr vs observed 28.79 yr, ratio < 1.12. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.cobalt60_ratio_lower","@t