-L263","doc":"Predicted half-life (seconds), from QOU formula. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.HalfLifePrediction.abs_delta_p","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.HalfLifePrediction.abs_delta_p","kind":"def","line":261,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L261-L261","doc":"Proton displacement |δp|. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.HalfLifePrediction.A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.HalfLifePrediction.A","kind":"def","line":259,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L259-L259","doc":"Mass number A. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.HalfLifePrediction.nucleus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.HalfLifePrediction.nucleus","kind":"def","line":257,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L257-L257","doc":"Name of the nucleus. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.HalfLifePrediction.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.HalfLifePrediction.mk","kind":"ctor","line":255,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/hadron-half-life-verification.lean#L255-L255","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.HalfLifePrediction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HalfLifeVerification.HalfLifePrediction","kind":"structure","line":251,"sourceLink":"https://gi